    "show_share": true,
    "description": "In order to meet and capitalize on emerging challenges and opportunities, remain contextually relevant and consolidate on existing strengths to allow for its continued excellence, the Medical College, Pakistan initiated a major strategic planning and strengthening exercise to deliberate and make recommendations with reference to the mission, vision and mandate of the Medical College, Pakistan and the Aga Khan University (AKU).",
